# Wave T43 (Coalseam kit): clinkerfloor — Coalseam City's registered street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the -floor suffix; the desire-path tiers key on it). CLINKER-ASH CARTWAY: packed near-black ash with a dense fine clinker aggregate — pale ash-grey and warm tan flecks, a sparse rust spark. Structurally a FINE DARK AGGREGATE: unlike Cragmoor's settfloor (large basalt blocks in a grid), Hushmoor's shinglefloor (daylight violet gravel) and Lilac's gridfloor (bronze lattice). No other town walks on black ground. (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T43-COALSEAM-PLAN.md §5.)
